============================================
FILE 2: .env.example
============================================
===========================================
Advanced Task Tracker - Environment Variables
===========================================
-----------------
Server Configuration
-----------------
PORT=5000
NODE_ENV=development
HOST=localhost
-----------------
Database Configuration
-----------------
PostgreSQL Example:
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://username:password@localhost:5432/task_tracker
SQLite Example:
DATABASE_URL=file:./dev.db
-----------------
Authentication & Security
-----------------
JWT_SECRET=your_super_secret_jwt_key_here_change_in_production
JWT_EXPIRE=7d
SESSION_SECRET=your_session_secret_key_here
BCRYPT_ROUNDS=10
-----------------
CORS Configuration
-----------------
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:3000
-----------------
Client/Frontend Configuration
-----------------
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000
VITE_APP_NAME=Advanced Task Tracker
VITE_APP_VERSION=1.0.0
-----------------
Email Configuration (Optional)
-----------------
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_SECURE=false
SMTP_USER=your_email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your_app_specific_password
EMAIL_FROM=noreply@tasktracker.com
-----------------
Cloud Storage (Optional)
-----------------
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your_aws_access_key
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your_aws_secret_key
AWS_REGION=us-east-1
AWS_BUCKET_NAME=task-tracker-uploads
-----------------
Third-Party Integrations (Optional)
-----------------
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your_google_client_secret
-----------------
Redis (Optional)
-----------------
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
-----------------
Logging
-----------------
LOG_LEVEL=info
LOG_FILE=logs/app.log
============================================